://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1809\n* build(deps-dev): bump react-i18next from 17.0.11 to 17.0.14 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1816\n* build(deps-dev): bump @types/node from 25.9.5 to 25.9.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1817\n* build(deps): bump @preact/signals from 2.11.1 to 2.11.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1815\n* build(deps-dev): bump antd from 6.6.2 to 6.6.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1818\n* build(deps-dev): bump @types/react-dom from 19.2.4 to 19.3.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1819\n\n## New Contributors\n* @malashkadev made their first contribution in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1809\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/compare/v2.8.5...v2.8.6","mentions_count":3}
